#38502
DK quest ADVICE~
0 d 100
advice~
wait 20
say First, gather provisions for a long campaign and gather adventurers to assist you.
wait 40
say When you've done that, you should begin by recovering &07the&00
say &07sword of shadows&00 which is guarded by Bezgarath the Deceiver.
wait 20
say He was once the caretaker of &07the darksword&00.
wait 50
say Next, you must enter The Legacy of Xchantharus
wait 30
say There, at the tomb of the knight you must defeat a
say spirit who guards a sphere of absolute darkness.
wait 40
say Meld those two items together.
wait 70
say Finally, you will need steel forged by the Gods.  A perfect specimen
say is currently in the hands of a troll king.  Take this from him and meld it!
wait 35
say Now you have a weapon of complete destruction.  It has cost
say you what soul you still had, knight.
~
$~
